{"productId": "2e95657e-c64f-4630-8fba-5934368bf825", "modelName": "M&P 2.0 Competitor", "modelDescription": "Built for competition right out of the box, this metal-framed 9mm pistol is designed to give competitive shooters the edge. The Competitor comes with a 5-inch barrel, has an enhanced sear for lighter, crisper trigger let-off, and includes a flared magazine well for fast and efficient reloads. Boasting a new look, the aggressive lightening cuts on both the top and sides of the slide ultimately reduce the amount of weight in front of the chamber and, in return, help improve the recoil balance point. The slide is cut for optics, includes a fiber optic front sight, and blacked out serrated rear sight. The Competitor comes with an oversized mag release that is reversible for both right and left-handed users and ships with a total of four magazines. Choose from models available in 10+1 or 17+1 round capacities with a Tungsten Gray Cerakote or black Armornite slide finish. Smith & Wesson is proud to introduce the Performance Center M&P9 M2.0 Competitor.", "manufacturerName": "Smith & Wesson", "subProducts": [{"isFirearm": true, "isNfa": false, "subProductId": "075b7d9c-b74f-4c98-8fc3-a9e5a028babc", "description": "Smith & Wesson, M&P M2.0 Competitor HD, 9mm Luger, 5\" Overall Black Armornite Stainless Steel Spiral Fluted Barrel, Lightening Cut/Optic Ready/Serrated Slide & Stainless Steel Frame w/Picatinny Rail, Interchangeable Palmswell Grip, No Thumb Safety, 10 Rounds\n\n", "imageUrls": ["https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/5c94fcd5-62a5-4ddc-9569-91cf1acfe42b", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/f0aea7c2-bc7e-4f70-9746-d7b218da8cac", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/9af53eb9-30dc-4b7e-864f-ba84e7d5c43d", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/a7be4483-1d91-4886-a7f8-eed76d0e9c31", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/1dce51cf-d1f7-4c92-a1ba-87dd22296fb5", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/S